 resolvePointer({ users: [{ name: 'Ada' }] }, '/users/0/name'); // 'Ada'
 ```
+
+## JSON Patch
+
+`applyPatch(document, patch)` applies an [RFC 6902 JSON Patch](https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc6902)
+and returns a new JSON document. It supports `add`, `remove`, `replace`, `move`, `copy`, and `test`;
+it throws if the patch is malformed or an operation cannot be completed.
+
+```ts
+import { applyPatch } from 'json-toolkit';
+
+applyPatch({ users: ['Ada'] }, [{ op: 'add', path: '/users/-', value: 'Lin' }]);
+// { users: ['Ada', 'Lin'] }
+```
